---
import IslandlyInfoLayout from '../../layouts/IslandlyInfoLayout.astro';
---

<IslandlyInfoLayout
  title="Islandly Account Deletion | Nortixlabs"
  description="How to delete your Islandly account and what happens after you request deletion."
  heading="Islandly Account Deletion"
  intro="Islandly supports account deletion from inside the app. This page explains how to initiate deletion and what to expect afterward."
>
  <div class="space-y-10 text-slate-300">
    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">How to delete your account</h2>
      <ol class="list-decimal space-y-3 pl-5">
        <li>Open the Islandly app on the device where you use your account.</li>
        <li>Go to your profile and open Settings.</li>
        <li>Choose the account deletion option and confirm the request in the app.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="leading-8">
        Islandly currently supports in-app initiation of deletion. This website page is informational and does not directly delete your account on its own.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">What happens after deletion</h2>
      <p class="leading-8">
        When deletion is completed, we aim to remove your account and associated app data from active systems, except where we are legally permitted or required to retain certain records for reasons such as fraud prevention, security, dispute handling, accounting, taxation, or legal compliance.
      </p>
      <p class="leading-8">
        Deleting the app from your device does not necessarily delete your backend account or server-side records.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Need help?</h2>
      <p class="leading-8">
        If you cannot access the app or need help with an account-related request, use the support options available through <a class="text-emerald-300 hover:text-emerald-200" href="https://nortixlabs.com">nortixlabs.com</a>.
      </p>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/60 p-5 text-sm text-slate-400">
        Related pages: <a class="text-emerald-300 hover:text-emerald-200" href="/islandly/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> and <a class="text-emerald-300 hover:text-emerald-200" href="/islandly/tos">Terms of Service</a>.
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</IslandlyInfoLayout>
